// Title: Chromium Browser Headless Execution To Mockbin Like Site
// ID: 1c526788-0abe-4713-862f-b520da5e5316
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: X__Junior (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2023-09-11
// Tags: attack.execution
// Description: Detects the execution of a Chromium based browser process with the "headless" flag and a URL pointing to the mockbin.org service (which can be used to exfiltrate data).
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "--headless")) AND ((where(Image IENDSWITH "\\brave.exe") OR where(Image IENDSWITH "\\chrome.exe") OR where(Image IENDSWITH "\\msedge.exe") OR where(Image IENDSWITH "\\opera.exe") OR where(Image IENDSWITH "\\vivaldi.exe"))) AND ((where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "://run.mocky") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "://mockbin"))))
